OL,3,GNEWSAKing to urge AI leaders 'not to
OL,4,Alose control of our destiny' at
OL,5,AScotland summit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King will tell AI bosses he's
OL,8,Fseeking reassurances we will "not lose
OL,9,Fcontrol of our destiny" at a summit in
OL,10,FScotland later - it's due to start at
OL,11,F12:30 BST
OL,13,FHe'll be joined by AI minister Kanishka
OL,14,FNarayan and representatives of tech
OL,15,Ffirms including OpenAI, Anthropic and
OL,16,FNvidia
OL,18,FThere have been a slew of warnings
OL,19,Frecently about the potential dangers AI
OL,20,Fposes for humans - here's a recap of
OL,21,Fthe debate
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
